1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,414
As water vapour rises, it cools.

2
00:00:03,764 --> 00:00:08,028
Cool vapour changes back into tiny droplets of liquid water.

3
00:00:08,378 --> 00:00:10,892
This is called condensation.

4
00:00:11,242 --> 00:00:14,956
Billions of droplets gather together to form clouds.

5
00:00:15,608 --> 00:00:20,691
A circuit needs a source of electrical energy, conducting paths, and a load.

6
00:00:21,041 --> 00:00:25,395
When the path is closed, current can flow and the bulb lights.

7
00:00:26,045 --> 00:00:30,399
The Estates-General met in 1789.

8
00:00:30,749 --> 00:00:34,722
Representatives of the Third Estate formed a National Assembly.

9
00:00:35,072 --> 00:00:41,400
On 14 July, a crowd in Paris took the Bastille, a royal fortress and prison.
